<title>POLAND: LENTEX APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>LENTEX APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.91 vs   0.52</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.33 vs   0.87</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.16 vs   0.91</p>
<p> Sales		   13.05 vs   8.89</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.28 vs   2.34</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.61 vs   3.68</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.64 vs   3.69</p>
<p> Sales		   42.55 vs  39.02</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish carpet maker is Lentex SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
